### 1. Suspicious: large online payment far from home at 3 AM, new device, failed attempts -> expected fraud: true
POST http://localhost:8080/api/fraud/predict
Content-Type: application/json

{"amount": 950, "customerAvgAmount": 45, "hourOfDay": 3, "distanceFromHomeKm": 850,
 "transactionsLast24h": 11, "failedAttemptsLast24h": 3, "online": true, "newDevice": true, "foreign": true}

### 2. Ordinary: small grocery payment near home in the afternoon -> expected fraud: false
POST http://localhost:8080/api/fraud/predict
Content-Type: application/json

{"amount": 42.10, "customerAvgAmount": 55, "hourOfDay": 13, "distanceFromHomeKm": 3.2,
 "transactionsLast24h": 2, "failedAttemptsLast24h": 0, "online": false, "newDevice": false, "foreign": false}

### 3. The suspicious payment for 1,000,000 EUR, far above any amount in the training data -> expected fraud: true
POST http://localhost:8080/api/fraud/predict
Content-Type: application/json

{"amount": 1000000, "customerAvgAmount": 45, "hourOfDay": 3, "distanceFromHomeKm": 850,
 "transactionsLast24h": 11, "failedAttemptsLast24h": 3, "online": true, "newDevice": true, "foreign": true}

### 4. Invalid values (negative amount, hour 25) -> 400 Bad Request that names both fields
POST http://localhost:8080/api/fraud/predict
Content-Type: application/json

{"amount": -5, "customerAvgAmount": 55, "hourOfDay": 25, "distanceFromHomeKm": 3.2,
 "transactionsLast24h": 2, "failedAttemptsLast24h": 0, "online": false, "newDevice": false, "foreign": false}

### 5. Missing fields -> 400 Bad Request that names them. Missing values are never replaced with defaults
POST http://localhost:8080/api/fraud/predict
Content-Type: application/json

{"amount": 42.10, "customerAvgAmount": 55}
